{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Sally's Health and Lifestyle Column", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Easy Does It", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 6, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 2, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.2", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Identify and describe events in the news in a range of social and work contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Talking About Someone's Feelings and Reactions", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You talk about feelings and reactions using adjectives.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Adjectives that end in <span class=\"strong\">-ed</span> are used to describe how a person feels, like <span class =\"italic\">depressed, distracted, distressed, surprised, worried</span> or <span class =\"italic\">tired</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Adjectives that end in <span class=\"strong\">-ing</span> are used to describe things and situations, like <span class =\"italic\">depressing, distracting, distressing, worrying</span> or <span class =\"italic\">tiring</span>.<br/>These adjectives describe the <span class =\"italic\">effect</span> something has on a person.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Depressed? Easily distracted? Easy Does It Workshops help individuals and groups overcome the problem of being overly serious.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "If one of these distressing situations applies to you, give us a call!", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Discussing How to Deal with Problems", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "To discuss how to deal with problems such as health issues, you can use modals like <span class =\"italic\">might, could,</span> or <span class =\"italic\">should</span>.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "These modals can go at the beginning of the sentence, or after a clause starting with <span class =\"italic\">\u201cIf ... \u201d</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The modal is followed by a verb in the base form. You do not use \u201cto\u201d. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Our specially trained team of psychologists could teach you how to cope with disappointment and loss.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You should join one of our groups, and within two months, a relaxed smile will replace that tense expression on your face.", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "workshop", "type": "name"}, {"content": " session of training or work focused on improvement", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Easy Does It Workshops help individuals and groups overcome the problem of being overly serious.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le02ob06aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use when you talk about a workshop.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "celebration", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an event recognizing an accomplishment", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Are you a member of a football team that hasn't had a victory celebration in ages?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le02ob06aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "psychologist", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a professional specializing in human psychology", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Our specially trained team of psychologists will teach how to deal with these issues.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le02ob06aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "disappointment", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the feeling of wanting something to be different or better", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  We will teach you how to cope with disappointment and loss.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le02ob06aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "silly", "type": "name"}, {"content": "not serious", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You will learn how and why to become totally silly.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le02ob06aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "workaholic", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a person who works excessively", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You will learn how to avoid becoming a workaholic.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le02ob06aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "accomplishment", "type": "name"}, {"content": "something you did that makes you feel proud", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The workshops will help you gain back your sense of humor and take pride in your accomplishments. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le02ob06aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"content": "engenn7le02ob06re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Start your dialogue by greeting your friend.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Talk about the reasons for stress in your lives.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Suggest taking an <span class=\"italic\">Easy Does It</span> workshop.  ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Explain the benefits of the workshop (relaxation, laughter, humor, etc.).", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Conclude your dialogue. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Change roles.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I write a dialogue of 50 - 70 words about ways to stay healthy.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk about the reasons for stress.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I discuss the benefits of the workshop.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I practice the dialogue.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn7le02ob06re2img01.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn7le02ob06re2img01.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "Are you depressed? Do you feel that you are easily distracted? Easy Does It Workshops help individuals and groups overcome the problem of being overly serious. <br/>Are you ...<ul><li>a nurse or doctor who works long hours?</li><li>a member of a football team that hasn't had a victory celebration in ages?</li><li>a bus or taxi driver who loses patience with traffic jams and rude passengers?</li><li>a single, working parent who has trouble coping with family and job-related responsibilities?</li></ul>"}, {"image": "engenn7le02ob06re2img02.jpg", "time": "36000", "id": 2, "text": "If one of these distressing situations applies to you, our specially trained team of psychologists could teach you:<ul><li>how to cope with disappointment and loss</li><li>how (and why) to become totally silly</li><li>how to make humor a regular part of your life</li><li>how to overcome failure and embarrassment</li><li>how to avoid becoming a workaholic</li></ul>"}, {"image": "engenn7le02ob06re2img03.jpg", "time": "61000", "id": 3, "text": "Our workshops could help you solve the frustrating problems that are weighing you down. They will help you gain back your sense of humor and take pride in your accomplishments. You should join one of our groups. Within two months, a relaxed smile will replace that tense expression on your face."}], "audiosrc": "engenn7le02ob06re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn7le02ob06re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "I can talk about staying healthy.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can talk about som